### 查询当前用户  通过token访问的格式如下：Authorization: Bearer
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMyIsInJvbGUiOiJwdWJsaWMiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5MzY5MTIyfQ.KFPXCppHQh9ptFV8eo2i3NLy51-C5US9Ju7LbZ1z93M

### 更新当前用户  通过token访问的格式如下：Authorization: Bearer
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8000/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiIxMyIsInJvbGUiOiJwdWJsaWMiLCJ0eXBlIjoiYWNjZXNzIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg5MzcyMTUzfQ.FysaT6otvr3r7vzK0cRhGTHvlzBBn9sEpT6Q2_oyT5A
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "student01",
  "email": "572201828@qq.com",
  "full_name": "更新后的课程学生"
}


### 修改密码。给我旧密码和新密码，给我修改成新的
